WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.885
The Tang Monk was tied up in a room.

2
00:00:03.886 --> 00:00:07.564
He heard his companions yelling at the monster.

3
00:00:07.565 --> 00:00:12.662
"Hand over the Tang Monk now!" shouted Bajie.

4
00:00:12.663 --> 00:00:17.500
[i@Clang!@i] The Tang Monk heard the sound of weapons clashing.

5
00:00:17.501 --> 00:00:22.072
"I hope they rescue me," said the monk.

6
00:00:22.073 --> 00:00:25.521
A young woman entered the room.

7
00:00:25.522 --> 00:00:28.939
"Wh-who are you?" asked the Tang Monk.

8
00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:31.970
"I'm a prisoner here," said the woman.

9
00:00:31.971 --> 00:00:37.201
"That monster kidnapped me 13 years ago and won't let me leave.

10
00:00:37.202 --> 00:00:39.201
Will you help me?"

11
00:00:39.202 --> 00:00:43.059
"I wish I could help you," said the Tang Monk.

12
00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:46.191
He showed the young woman his ropes.

13
00:00:46.192 --> 00:00:49.547
"I can help you get free," said the young woman.

14
00:00:49.548 --> 00:00:53.858
"If I do, will you deliver a letter to my parents?"

15
00:00:53.859 --> 00:00:58.403
"Of course," said the monk. "Who are your parents?"

16
00:00:58.404 --> 00:01:03.981
"They're the king and queen of the Precious Image Kingdom," said the young woman.

17
00:01:03.982 --> 00:01:10.603
"My name is Princess Hundred Flowers."

18
00:01:10.604 --> 00:01:19.202
Bajie and Wujing were still fighting the monster when the princess ran outside.

19
00:01:19.203 --> 00:01:24.771
"Monster!" she cried. "I must ask you a favor."

20
00:01:24.772 --> 00:01:29.391
Right away the monster stopped fighting and turned to the princess.

21
00:01:29.392 --> 00:01:34.426
"What can I do for you, my sweet?" asked the monster.

22
00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:37.744
"There's a monk inside," said the princess.

23
00:01:37.745 --> 00:01:41.185
[g@"It makes me so sad to see him tied up.

24
00:01:41.186 --> 00:01:43.390
Won't you let him go?"@g]

25
00:01:43.391 --> 00:01:46.657
[g@The monster hesitated.

26
00:01:46.658 --> 00:01:52.342
"That monk isn't an ordinary monk. He's the—"@g]

27
00:01:52.343 --> 00:01:55.892
Princess Hundred Flowers pretended to cry.

28
00:01:55.893 --> 00:01:58.359
[g@The monster held up his hands.

29
00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:00.780
"Okay, okay, sweetie.@g]

30
00:02:00.781 --> 00:02:04.297
[g@You know I only want you to be happy.

31
00:02:04.298 --> 00:02:07.015
The monk may go."@g]

32
00:02:07.016 --> 00:02:10.660
The monster followed the princess back inside.

33
00:02:10.661 --> 00:02:14.857
Bajie and Wujing looked at each other in confusion.

34
00:02:14.858 --> 00:02:20.155
"The monster is going to free him?" mumbled Bajie.

35
00:02:20.156 --> 00:02:25.660
A moment later the Tang Monk came out.

36
00:02:25.661 --> 00:02:31.837
"There's something we must do," he said quietly to his companions.

37
00:02:31.838 --> 00:02:37.611
Later that day the travelers reached the palace of the Precious Image Kingdom.

38
00:02:37.612 --> 00:02:40.827
[g@The queen was reading the letter from her daughter.

39
00:02:40.828 --> 00:02:43.224
Tears were in her eyes.@g]

40
00:02:43.225 --> 00:02:46.573
[g@"Our poor daughter," said the queen.

41
00:02:46.574 --> 00:02:50.260
"She's been a prisoner all this time."@g]

42
00:02:50.261 --> 00:02:55.364
The king stood up, his eyes blazing with anger.

43
00:02:55.365 --> 00:02:59.313
He called to his general, who was standing nearby.

44
00:02:59.314 --> 00:03:01.786
"Gather your troops," said the king.

45
00:03:01.787 --> 00:03:03.795
[g@"I want my daughter back.

46
00:03:03.796 --> 00:03:08.254
And I want that monster destroyed!"@g]

47
00:03:08.255 --> 00:03:11.143
"Forgive me, Your Majesty," said the general.

48
00:03:11.144 --> 00:03:13.076
[g@"But we are just men.

49
00:03:13.077 --> 00:03:17.126
How can we defeat such a powerful monster?"@g]

50
00:03:17.127 --> 00:03:20.198
"My two companions are powerful spirits, Your Majesty."

51
00:03:20.199 --> 00:03:22.619
[g@The Tang Monk spoke up.

52
00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:28.443
"I'm sure they can rescue your daughter."@g]

53
00:03:28.444 --> 00:03:33.326
Soon Bajie and Wujing were back at the pagoda.

54
00:03:33.327 --> 00:03:36.131
[g@The pig swung his rake.

55
00:03:36.132 --> 00:03:39.800
[i@Crash!@i] The door exploded.@g]

56
00:03:39.801 --> 00:03:43.638
"Get out here, you rotten monster!" he shouted.

57
00:03:43.639 --> 00:03:46.066
[g@The monster ran outside.

58
00:03:46.067 --> 00:03:49.160
"You brutes!" he yelled.@g]

59
00:03:49.161 --> 00:03:51.823
[g@"I let the monk go free.

60
00:03:51.824 --> 00:03:55.491
Why did you smash my door down?"@g]

61
00:03:55.492 --> 00:03:58.906
"We're here for the princess," said Wujing.

62
00:03:58.907 --> 00:04:02.665
"The king of the Precious Image Kingdom sent us."

63
00:04:02.666 --> 00:04:07.341
[g@"You can't take the princess away," said the monster.

64
00:04:07.342 --> 00:04:09.941
"We are in love."@g]

65
00:04:09.942 --> 00:04:12.595
[g@Bajie and Wujing attacked.

66
00:04:12.596 --> 00:04:15.337
The monster blocked their weapons.@g]

67
00:04:15.338 --> 00:04:20.341
They fought for over an hour.

68
00:04:20.342 --> 00:04:24.763
Finally Bajie, tired from fighting, turned and ran.

69
00:04:24.764 --> 00:04:27.849
[g@Wujing was furious.

70
00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:32.820
"Bajie!" he shouted. "Where are you—oof!"@g]

71
00:04:32.821 --> 00:04:38.598
The monster knocked out Wujing and tied him up.

72
00:04:38.599 --> 00:04:44.632
He dragged Wujing into the pagoda and locked him in a room.

73
00:04:44.633 --> 00:04:50.480
"The king knows that the princess is here," said the monster to himself.

74
00:04:50.481 --> 00:04:55.452
"But how?" He tapped his chin and thought.

75
00:04:55.453 --> 00:04:57.803
"Aha!" he said.

76
00:04:57.804 --> 00:05:02.552
"The princess must have asked that monk to go to the king."

77
00:05:02.553 --> 00:05:05.508
[g@His eyes became dark and angry.

78
00:05:05.509 --> 00:05:12.047
"She tricked me!"@g]

